  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Bump libkrun to keep guest addresses to their proxy's family by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1753\n* Bump libkrun to map guest RAM 2 MiB-congruent by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1756\n* Bump the Nix package to 1.27.3 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1755\n* Bump ruzstd to 0.9.1 for RUSTSEC-2026-0344 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1759\n* Stop a guest process hanging when the host truncates a file it maps through DAX by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1758\n* Bump version to 1.27.4. by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1762\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.27.3...v1.27.4",
